STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT /*
COMMENT  * SurfOS symbols 12x24, 10/25/26
COMMENT  * Copyright (c) 2026, Brandon Burr
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * The code page 437 characters the console needs that Spleen 12x24
COMMENT  * (spleen-12x24.bdf next to this file) does not have. tools/bdf2c.py takes
COMMENT  * a glyph from here only where Spleen has none.
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * Drawn for SurfOS in Spleen 12x24's manner (vertical strokes two pixels,
COMMENT  * horizontal ones one): SurfOS's breadcrumb triangle U+25B8 on the small
COMMENT  * letters' middle row, its wave U+224B (three of Spleen's U+2248 tildes,
COMMENT  * centred where = and > are), U+25C4 and U+221F as in the 8x16 symbols,
COMMENT  * the arrows U+2190-2195 and U+21A8, the triangles U+25B2 and U+25BC,
COMMENT  * U+25AC, U+2261, U+221E, and the integral's halves U+2320 and U+2321,
COMMENT  * which meet across two rows.
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * The others are Spleen 8x16's own glyphs, Copyright (c) 2018-2026,
COMMENT  * Frederic Cambus, set in the bigger cell two columns in: the symbols
COMMENT  * U+263A-263C, U+2640, U+2642, U+2660, U+2663, U+266A, U+266B and U+2302
COMMENT  * in the middle of the capitals' band, the letters U+20A7, U+0192 and the
COMMENT  * Greek ones on the baseline, so they keep Spleen's drawing at its smaller
COMMENT  * size.
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * Released under the BSD 2-Clause license, the same terms as Spleen
COMMENT  * (LICENSE-spleen in this directory, with these copyright lines), so the
COMMENT  * table generated from both fonts, driver/font12x24.c, has one license.
COMMENT  *
COMMENT  * SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
COMMENT  */
FONT -surfos-symbols-medium-r-normal--24-240-72-72-C-120-ISO10646-1
SIZE 24 72 72
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 12 24 0 -5
STARTPROPERTIES 7
FAMILY_NAME "SurfOS Symbols"
WEIGHT_NAME "Medium"
SPACING "C"
FONT_ASCENT 19
FONT_DESCENT 5
COPYRIGHT "Copyright (c) 2026, Brandon Burr; Copyright (c) 2018-2026, Frederic Cambus"
DEFAULT_CHAR 32
ENDPROPERTIES
